The ServerConfiguration type is referenced in the ServerConfigurationManager.cs file but not defined there. It is likely defined in the MediaBrowser.Model.Configuration namespace or a related project. Since I cannot find the PluginManifest type or ServerConfiguration type source files directly, I will create minimal stub classes for these types in the test file to allow compilation and focus on testing the SaveManifest method and the logging behavior.

I will submit a test file with the necessary stubs and the tests for SaveManifest including the coverage of the LogWarning call on the ILogger.

